  "text": "P\nPhenoFarm\nCULTIVATOR\n16\nGrower Settings\n\nManage your account, subscription, and wholesale terms\n\nCultivator Subscription\nFREE\n\nThis is the only payment flow in PhenoFarm.\n\nGrowers pay PhenoFarm a software subscription. Wholesale order payments are handled directly between buyers and sellers outside the app.\n\nFree Plan\n\nStarter access\n\n$0/mo\n\nPlan Features\nExpanded catalog listings\nPriority grower support\nEstimated request value reports\nAdvanced integrations\nUpgrade to Pro\n\nOnline subscription checkout is currently unavailable.\n\nWholesale Settlement\n\nPhenoFarm does not process payments from dispensaries to growers. Use this app to coordinate quotes, order requests, fulfillment, and records; settle wholesale invoices directly with each buyer.\n\nThe only in-app payment flow for growers is the cultivator subscription paid to PhenoFarm.\n\nREUSABLE DEFAULTS\n\nCommercial terms\n\nSaved to your account and shown to buyers on your shop page.\n\nReset defaults\nSave terms\nDefault MOQ\nFulfillment methods\nFulfillment region\nDirect payment terms\nResponse window\nContact note\n\nThese terms are informational defaults only. PhenoFarm does not collect or remit wholesale payments between businesses.\n\nBusiness Information\n\nREQUIRED FIRST\n\nFinish business name, license, expiry date, and email first. Logo, address, website, and description can be completed later.\n\nBusiness Name *\nContact Name (optional)\nBusiness License Number *\nLicense Expiry Date *\nBusiness Email *\nBusiness Phone (optional)\nBusiness Address (Autocomplete)\n\nType 3+ characters to see suggestions (includes city, state, ZIP)\n\nWebsite (optional)\nDescription (optional)\n\n52/500\n\nCompany Logo\nNo logo\nUpload Logo\n\nJPG, PNG, or WebP. Max 500KB.\n\nAccount\n\nSign out of your grower account from this device.\n\nSettings drafts save in this browser.\n\nSave settings\nIntegrations\n\nMetrc state-tracking sync\n\nIn development. Your batch and COA records are structured for future synchronization; no automatic Metrc sync runs today.",
